1c:["$","$L21",null,{"items":[{"id":"chevening-2027","title":"Chevening Scholarships 2027–2028","provider":"UK Government","type":"Scholarship","level":"Master's","country":"United Kingdom","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"2027–2028 application round closed; follow the existing-applicant timeline","deadlineDate":"$undefined","deadlineAt":"$undefined","status":"Closed","summary":"The 2027–2028 scholarship application round is closed. Existing applicants should follow the official assessment, interview and later university-offer instructions.","tags":["Leadership","International students","One-year master's"],"source":"https://www.chevening.org/scholarship/pakistan/","sourceLabel":"Chevening Pakistan: current application status","checked":"28 October 2026","featured":false},{"id":"rhodes-2027","title":"Rhodes Scholarship 2027","provider":"Rhodes Trust","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","country":"United Kingdom","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"2027-entry round closed; next applications reopen in 2027 for 2028 entry","status":"Closed","summary":"Applications are closed. Prepare by constituency and eligible Oxford course; future-cycle exact dates must come from the next official call.","tags":["Oxford","Postgraduate","Leadership"],"source":"https://www.rhodeshouse.ox.ac.uk/scholarships/the-rhodes-scholarship/","sourceLabel":"Rhodes Trust: current application status","checked":"24 October 2026","featured":false},{"id":"gates-cambridge-2027","title":"Gates Cambridge Scholarship","provider":"University of Cambridge","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","country":"United Kingdom","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"International: 8 Dec 2026 or 6 Jan 2027, course-dependent; U.S. round closed","deadlineDate":"$undefined","milestones":[{"label":"International funding deadline: course-dependent December option","date":"2026-12-08","at":"2026-12-08T23:59:00Z","detail":"Your course determines whether December or January applies; references must be complete."},{"label":"International funding deadline: course-dependent January option","date":"2027-01-06","at":"2027-01-06T23:59:00Z","detail":"Not a second chance after a December deadline. Check your course and Gates route."}],"status":"Check official site","summary":"The U.S. deadline has passed. Other eligible applicants must check the exact course funding deadline and Gates route; a complete application includes references.","tags":["Cambridge","Master's","PhD"],"source":"https://www.postgraduate.study.cam.ac.uk/funding","sourceLabel":"Cambridge: 2027–28 funding deadlines","checked":"24 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"commonwealth-masters-2027","title":"Commonwealth Master's Scholarships 2027–2028","provider":"Commonwealth Scholarship Commission","type":"Scholarship","level":"Master's","country":"United Kingdom","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"20 October 2026, 16:00 BST","deadlineDate":"2026-10-20","status":"Closed","summary":"The published central 2027–2028 deadline of 20 October 2026 at 16:00 BST has passed. Existing applicants should retain confirmations and follow CSC and nominator instructions; check the official portal for any amendment.","tags":["Commonwealth","Development","Master's"],"source":"https://cscuk.fcdo.gov.uk/scholarships/commonwealth-masters-scholarships/","sourceLabel":"Commonwealth Scholarship Commission","checked":"23 October 2026","featured":false,"deadlineAt":"2026-10-20T16:00:00+01:00"},{"id":"commonwealth-phd-2027","title":"Commonwealth PhD Scholarships 2027–2028","provider":"Commonwealth Scholarship Commission","type":"Scholarship","level":"PhD","country":"United Kingdom","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"20 October 2026, 16:00 BST","deadlineDate":"2026-10-20","status":"Closed","summary":"The published central 2027–2028 deadline of 20 October 2026 at 16:00 BST has passed. Existing applicants should retain confirmations and follow CSC and nominator instructions; check the official portal for any amendment.","tags":["Commonwealth","Research","PhD"],"source":"https://cscuk.fcdo.gov.uk/scholarships/commonwealth-phd-scholarships-for-least-developed-countries-and-vulnerable-states/","sourceLabel":"Commonwealth Scholarship Commission","checked":"23 October 2026","featured":false,"deadlineAt":"2026-10-20T16:00:00+01:00"},{"id":"erasmus-mundus-2027","title":"Erasmus Mundus Joint Masters 2027","provider":"European Union","type":"Scholarship","level":"Master's","country":"Multiple European countries","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"Consortium-specific; check the current programme call","status":"Check official site","summary":"Joint master's programmes use their own calls and scholarship deadlines. The European Commission describes many applications between October and January, but this umbrella record is not a confirmed open call.","tags":["Europe","Joint degree","Mobility"],"source":"https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/opportunities/individuals/students/erasmus-mundus-joint-masters","sourceLabel":"European Commission – Erasmus+","checked":"28 October 2026","featured":true,"deadlineDate":"$undefined","deadlineAt":"$undefined"},{"id":"daad-epos-2027","title":"DAAD EPOS Scholarships 2027–2028","provider":"DAAD","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","country":"Germany","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"2027–2028 course list published; scholarship deadlines vary by course","status":"Check official site","summary":"DAAD links the 2027–2028 EPOS course list. Check eligible country, relevant degree and at least two years of related experience after the bachelor's degree. Submit to the selected course by its own scholarship deadline; an umbrella listing is not a confirmed open call.","tags":["Germany","Development","Professional experience"],"source":"https://www2.daad.de/deutschland/stipendium/datenbank/en/21148-scholarship-database/?detail=50076777","sourceLabel":"DAAD scholarship database","checked":"28 October 2026","featured":true,"deadlineDate":"$undefined","deadlineAt":"$undefined"},{"id":"stipendium-hungaricum","title":"Stipendium Hungaricum Scholarship","provider":"Government of Hungary","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Hungary","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"Apply page still labels 2026–2027; a 2027–2028 deadline is not confirmed here","status":"Check official site","summary":"On 28 October the official apply page still labels its calls 2026–2027. A registration button does not establish that a new funding round is open. Confirm the new call and sending-partner requirements before submitting.","tags":["Hungary","Bachelor's","Master's","PhD"],"source":"https://stipendiumhungaricum.hu/apply/","sourceLabel":"Stipendium Hungaricum official website","checked":"28 October 2026","deadlineDate":"$undefined","deadlineAt":"$undefined"},{"id":"italy-maeci-2026-27","title":"MAECI Italian Government Grants 2026–2027","provider":"Italian Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"26 March 2026, 14:00 Italian time — closed","deadlineDate":"2026-03-26","status":"Closed","summary":"The current call is closed. MAECI grants use an annual eligible-country list and the official Study in Italy application portal for study carried out in Italy.","tags":["Italian Government","MAECI","Study in Italy"],"source":"https://www.esteri.it/en/servizi-opportunita/opportunita/borse-di-studio/per-cittadini-stranieri/borsestudio_stranieri/","sourceLabel":"Italian Ministry of Foreign Affairs","checked":"13 October 2026"},{"id":"italy-ergo-dsu-2026-27","title":"ER.GO Regional Scholarship 2026–2027","provider":"ER.GO Emilia-Romagna","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"24 August 2026, 16:00 — main scholarship deadline closed","deadlineDate":"2026-08-24","status":"Closed","summary":"Regional right-to-study support assessed under ER.GO's economic, enrolment and merit rules, with separate guidance for families holding income or assets abroad.","tags":["DSU","Emilia-Romagna","Income assessed"],"source":"https://www.er-go.it/cosa-fare-per/bandi-di-concorso/leggi-il-bando","sourceLabel":"ER.GO official 2026–2027 call","checked":"13 October 2026"},{"id":"padua-international-excellence-2026-27","title":"Padua International Excellence Scholarship","provider":"University of Padua","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"2027–2028 award terms: verify on the official scholarship page","status":"Check official site","summary":"The 2026–2027 scheme offered €8,000 gross per year plus a tuition-fee exemption for selected international students in eligible English-taught degrees.","tags":["Padua","Merit","English-taught degree"],"source":"https://www.unipd.it/en/padua-international-excellence-scholarship-programme","sourceLabel":"University of Padua","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"polimi-merit-scholarships-2027-28","title":"Politecnico di Milano International Merit Scholarships","provider":"Politecnico di Milano","type":"Scholarship","level":"Master's","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"15 December 2026, noon Italian time; early admission payment required by 1 December","deadlineDate":"2026-12-15","deadlineAt":"2026-12-15T12:00:00+01:00","milestones":[{"label":"Required early admission payment","date":"2026-12-01","detail":"Confirm your eligible early-bird route and closing time."},{"label":"Merit scholarship form","date":"2026-12-15","at":"2026-12-15T12:00:00+01:00","detail":"Noon Italian time; prior admission conditions apply."}],"status":"Open","summary":"The 2027–2028 merit call has a separate form closing 15 December at noon Italian time, after qualifying early admission payment by 1 December. The PDF lists an acceptance administrative fee around €190; check award-specific benefits and English evidence.","tags":["Polimi","Master of Science","Tuition waiver"],"source":"https://www.polimi.it/en/prospective-students/how-much-does-it-cost/scholarships","sourceLabel":"Politecnico di Milano","checked":"23 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"open-doors-2026","title":"Open Doors: 2026 competition for study in Russia","provider":"Global Universities Association","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","supportedDegrees":["Bachelor's","Master's","PhD"],"country":"Russia","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"Registration: 1 November 2026; confirm account cut-off","deadlineDate":"2026-11-01","status":"Open","summary":"Tuition-free study routes with university-dependent stipend; additional support has separate conditions. Choose the correct academic track and follow the official stages.","tags":["Bachelor’s","Master’s","PhD","Track-specific rules"],"source":"https://od.globaluni.ru/","sourceLabel":"Official Open Doors rules, schedule and FAQ","checked":"24 October 2026"},{"id":"turkiye-next","title":"Türkiye Scholarships: prepare for the next degree call","provider":"Türkiye Scholarships / YTB","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","supportedDegrees":["Bachelor's","Master's","PhD"],"country":"Türkiye","region":"Europe","funding":"Fully funded","deadline":"Annual Jan–Feb calendar; next named call must be verified","status":"Check official site","summary":"Degree funding with placement and level-specific academic/age conditions. The published annual calendar does not confirm that the next intake is open.","tags":["Degree placement","TBBS","Level-specific requirements"],"source":"https://www.turkiyeburslari.gov.tr/fulltimeprograms","sourceLabel":"Türkiye Scholarships official full-time programme","checked":"24 October 2026"}],"showTypeFilter":false}]
1d:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[null,["$","section","1-Build a country-by-country shortlist",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a country-by-country shortlist"}],[["$","p","Erasmus Mundus degrees span multiple institutions and countries, while DAAD and Stipendium Hungaricum operate within national systems. Tuition, visa rules and work options still depend on the host country.",{"children":"Erasmus Mundus degrees span multiple institutions and countries, while DAAD and Stipendium Hungaricum operate within national systems. Tuition, visa rules and work options still depend on the host country."}],["$","p","Compare the programme consortium, mobility path, language, degree award and funding terms—not just the headline destination.",{"children":"Compare the programme consortium, mobility path, language, degree award and funding terms—not just the headline destination."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Check whether the degree moves between countries",{"children":"Check whether the degree moves between countries"}],["$","li","Confirm scholarship and programme deadlines",{"children":"Confirm scholarship and programme deadlines"}],["$","li","Review residence-permit rules for each mobility stage",{"children":"Review residence-permit rules for each mobility stage"}],["$","li","Compare living allowances with local costs",{"children":"Compare living allowances with local costs"}],["$","li","Verify the final degree title and awarding institutions",{"children":"Verify the final degree title and awarding institutions"}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Three funding routes that work differently",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Three funding routes that work differently"}],[["$","p","Erasmus Mundus funding is tied to a specific joint master's programme, whose consortium sets language, admission and scholarship instructions. DAAD EPOS supports eligible development-related postgraduate courses in Germany, with course-specific applications and professional-experience conditions. Stipendium Hungaricum depends on a country sending partner, eligible Hungarian university courses and a nomination stage.",{"children":"Erasmus Mundus funding is tied to a specific joint master's programme, whose consortium sets language, admission and scholarship instructions. DAAD EPOS supports eligible development-related postgraduate courses in Germany, with course-specific applications and professional-experience conditions. Stipendium Hungaricum depends on a country sending partner, eligible Hungarian university courses and a nomination stage."}],["$","p","Do not apply a rule from one route to another. Check the official course and programme pages before deciding whether a degree, applicant nationality or language document qualifies.",{"children":"Do not apply a rule from one route to another. Check the official course and programme pages before deciding whether a degree, applicant nationality or language document qualifies."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Erasmus: programme consortium and mobility plan",{"children":"Erasmus: programme consortium and mobility plan"}],["$","li","Germany: course application and DAAD eligibility",{"children":"Germany: course application and DAAD eligibility"}],["$","li","Hungary: sending partner plus host admission",{"children":"Hungary: sending partner plus host admission"}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","3-Budget for the exact location and mobility pattern",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":["$L22",["$L23","$L24"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L25"]}]
1e:["$","section",null,{"className":"source-section","aria-labelledby":"official-sources","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"official-sources","children":"Official sources and verification"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Source records support the guide. Page update dates describe editorial changes; they do not mean every linked rule was checked again today. Reopen the current call for your programme and intake."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"source-grid","children":[["$","$L4","https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/opportunities/individuals/students/erasmus-mundus-joint-masters",{"href":"https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/opportunities/individuals/students/erasmus-mundus-joint-masters","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Erasmus Mundus Joint Masters"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"European Commission programme overview"}]]}],["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M15 3h6v6","key":"1q9fwt"}],["path",{"d":"M10 14 21 3","key":"gplh6r"}],["path",{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6","key":"a6xqqp"}]],"className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","https://www2.daad.de/deutschland/stipendium/datenbank/en/21148-scholarship-database/?detail=50076777",{"href":"https://www2.daad.de/deutschland/stipendium/datenbank/en/21148-scholarship-database/?detail=50076777","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"DAAD EPOS"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"DAAD scholarship database"}]]}],["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1e:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","https://stipendiumhungaricum.hu/apply/",{"href":"https://stipendiumhungaricum.hu/apply/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Stipendium Hungaricum"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Official application information"}]]}],["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1e:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","https://www.daad.de/en/studying-in-germany/scholarships/daad-scholarships/",{"href":"https://www.daad.de/en/studying-in-germany/scholarships/daad-scholarships/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"DAAD scholarship database"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Official German Academic Exchange Service"}]]}],["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1e:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","https://stipendiumhungaricum.hu/",{"href":"https://stipendiumhungaricum.hu/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Stipendium Hungaricum"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Official Hungarian scholarship programme"}]]}],["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1e:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section",null,{"className":"faq-section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Frequently asked questions"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","details","Is there one scholarship application for studying in Europe?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Is there one scholarship application for studying in Europe?",["$","span",null,{"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"No. Erasmus Mundus, DAAD, Stipendium Hungaricum and university awards use different application systems. Start with the exact programme and country, then follow that programme owner's current instructions."}]]}],["$","details","Does a European scholarship automatically cover every living cost?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Does a European scholarship automatically cover every living cost?",["$","span",null,{"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Not necessarily. Tuition, stipend, accommodation, insurance and travel coverage differ by award and city. Compare the official benefit list with the cost of the actual study location."}]]}],["$","details","Should I choose a country or a scholarship first?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Should I choose a country or a scholarship first?",["$","span",null,{"children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Choose the degree and realistic destinations together. A strong shortlist matches academic fit, eligibility, funding and the admission route rather than chasing a funding label alone."}]]}]]}]]}]
20:["$","aside",null,{"className":"content-sidebar","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"sidebar-card sidebar-card--contents","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"On this page"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Page contents","children":[["$","a","Choose your next destination step",{"href":"#section-1","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"01"}],"Choose your next destination step"]}],["$","a","Build a country-by-country shortlist",{"href":"#section-2","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"02"}],"Build a country-by-country shortlist"]}],["$","a","Three funding routes that work differently",{"href":"#section-3","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"03"}],"Three funding routes that work differently"]}],["$","a","Budget for the exact location and mobility pattern",{"href":"#section-4","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"04"}],"Budget for the exact location and mobility pattern"]}],["$","a","Italy: connect funding to the regional and university system",{"href":"#section-5","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"05"}],"Italy: connect funding to the regional and university system"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"sidebar-card","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Next useful step"}],[["$","$L4","countries/italy",{"href":"/countries/italy/","children":["Scholarships and study routes in Italy for international students"," ",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","scholarships/italy",{"href":"/scholarships/italy/","children":["Scholarships in Italy for international students"," ",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]]}]]}]
